\,\\exists\\delta\\,\\exists q_0\\,\\exists q_{\\mathsf{acc}}\\,\\exists q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\;\\Bigl(\nM=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\\land\n0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Gamma)\\land\n\\mathrm{blank}\\in\\Gamma\\land\\Sigma\\subseteq\\Gamma\\setminus\\{\\mathrm{blank}\\}\\land\n\\delta:(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\})\\times\\Gamma\n\\to Q\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}\\land\nq_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\in Q\\land\n|\\{q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\}|=3\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DTM}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\land\n\\exists Q\\,\\exists\\Gamma\\,\\exists\\mathrm{blank}\\,\\exists\\delta\\,\\exists q_0\\,\\exists q_{\\mathsf{acc}}\\,\\exists q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\;\\Bigl(\nM=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\\land\n0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Gamma)\\land\n\\mathrm{blank}\\in\\Gamma\\land\\Sigma\\subseteq\\Gamma\\setminus\\{\\mathrm{blank}\\}\\land\n\\delta:(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\})\\times\\Gamma\n\\to Q\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}\\land\nq_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\in Q\\land\n|\\{q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\}|=3\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{M:\\operatorname{DTM}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{M:\\operatorname{DTM}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The transition is total exactly on nonhalting states, and the blank symbol is a tape symbol but not an input symbol.</li>\n<li>Machine collections are used as metatheoretic classes of set-coded tuples; no quantifier treats a proper class as a set-valued function.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$ (input alphabet, see [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{blank}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{blank}\\in\\Gamma\\setminus\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DTM}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\land\n\\exists Q\\,\\exists\\Gamma\\,\\exists\\mathrm{blank}\\,\\exists\\delta\\,\\exists q_0\\,\\exists q_{\\mathsf{acc}}\\,\\exists q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\;\\Bigl(\nM=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\\land\n0<|Q|<\\aleph_0\\land\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Gamma)\\land\n\\mathrm{blank}\\in\\Gamma\\land\\Sigma\\subseteq\\Gamma\\setminus\\{\\mathrm{blank}\\}\\land\n\\delta:(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\})\\times\\Gamma\n\\to Q\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}\\land\nq_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\in Q\\land\n|\\{q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\}|=3\n\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{M:\\operatorname{DTM}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\}","display":true}],"bytes":2542,"backlinks":[{"id":"db96cabedd089e5f","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{blank}$ 是机器八元组中的空白字符分量，见 [[73-df-eight-tuple-dtm]]；表格子句的机器见证 $S$ 取自 $\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}$，其八个分量由 $\\pi_1,\\ldots,\\pi_8$ 读取。"},{"id":"8dd5a913cb2152a3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}$ (single-tape DTM, see [[73-df-eight-tuple-dtm]])"},{"id":"e0b452dd8be3146b","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\sqcup$ 是本接口固定的空白字符，$\\sqcup\\notin\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}$；$L=\\mathsf L$、$R=\\mathsf R$ 是 [[73-df-eight-tuple-dtm]] 的两个方向。"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-161","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-eight-tuple-dtm|Deterministic Single-Tape Turing Machine]]"}],"outgoing":["0a6da8c909717780"]}